  <item>
    <title>02. 新闻主播👉美妆博主？千万粉自媒体如何炼成？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6424f94373768bea35c6f29c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6424f94373768bea35c6f29c</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Mar 2023 02:51:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期大聪明】</span></p><span></span><p><span>@主播潘小蓉 ZMG新闻主播，跨平台全网千万粉博主</span></p><span></span><p><span>@志强 ZMG新闻个人号内容运营，账号全网八百万粉</span></p><span></span><p><span>@所长bibabo ZMG新闻主播，数码区UP主，全网百万粉（差90万那种），哈哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【你将听到】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 内容集锦，辛苦拼的，听一下吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a> intro，商业互吹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 主播潘小蓉“挺愿意称自己为跨平台跨账号博主”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> 那么不垂直，但那么吸粉？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> 从头摸索，给自己的boss运营账号是什么体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> 对“热点”是怎么理解的？灵感来源？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a> “热点”永远是过去的“热点”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1132">18:52</a> 一个人如何起号？人设？时间管理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> 会被“流量”裹挟吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> 内容运营者，为什么不做自己的账号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a> 如何克服“孤独感”，如何与自己较劲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2856">47:36</a> 如何平衡投入与产出，起号需要不计成本吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3326">55:26</a> 未来的大计划！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3820">01:03:40</a> 所长的自媒体感悟～</span></p>]]></description>
